# Directory Structure

## Root Layout

```
knowledge-base/
├── master-index.json           # Registry of all KBs
├── technical/                  # Layer 1: Technical KB
├── sound-design/                # Layer 2: Sound Design KB
├── ui-ux/                       # Layer 3: UI/UX KB
├── commercial/                  # Layer 4: Commercial KB
├── reference/                   # Layer 5: Reference KB
└── bridge/                      # Bridge layer
```

## Per-Layer Structure

Each KB layer follows this structure:

```
{layer-name}/
├── index.json                  # File listing by topic
├── manifest.json               # Status and sync history
└── topics/
    ├── {topic-1}/
    │   ├── {entry-id}.json
    │   └── {entry-id}.json
    ├── {topic-2}/
    │   ├── {entry-id}.json
    │   └── {entry-id}.json
    └── ...
```

